            "title": "Anvil State Metrics",
            "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
            "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "## Anvil State Metrics\n\nAnvil (local Ethereum node) state metrics will be populated once custom counters are added.\n\nExpected metrics (using `sentinel_*` prefix):\n- `sentinel_anvil_block_number` — current block number on the local fork\n- `sentinel_anvil_transactions_submitted_total` — transactions submitted via Anvil (labels: `sender`, `type`)\n- `sentinel_anvil_transaction_errors_total` — failed transaction counter\n- `sentinel_anvil_impersonated_accounts_total` — number of impersonated accounts active\n- `sentinel_anvil_snapshot_restores_total` — number of state snapshot restores (used in test scenarios)\n\nAnvil is the local fork node used for simulation and live defense testing in SENTINEL."
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "stat",
            "title": "api-gateway up (Anvil proxy)",
            "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus" },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": { "type": "prometheus" },
                    "expr": "up{job=\"api-gateway\"}",
                    "refId": "A"
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
                    "mappings": [{ "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN" }, "1": { "text": "UP" } }, "type": "value" }],
                    "thresholds": {
                        "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }]
                    }
                }
            },
            "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" }
        },
        {
            "type": "timeseries",
            "title": "sentinel_anvil_* metrics (placeholder — no data until custom counters added)",
            "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus" },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": { "type": "prometheus" },
                    "expr": "{__name__=~\"sentinel_anvil_.*\"}",
                    "legendFormat": "{{__name__}} {{job}}",
                    "refId": "A"
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
                }
            },
            "options": { "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
